#: ~pyasn1.error.PyAsn1Error
#:     On encoding errors
#:
#: Examples
#: --------
#: Encode ASN.1 value object into native Python types
#:
#: .. code-block:: pycon
#:
#:    >>> seq = SequenceOf(componentType=Integer())
#:    >>> seq.extend([1, 2, 3])
#:    >>> encode(seq)
#:    [1, 2, 3]
